<title>USA: Pediatric Services acquires nursing co.</title>
<headline>Pediatric Services acquires nursing co.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pediatric Services of America Inc said Wednesday it has acquired  Concerned Nursing Care Inc, a company that provides pediatric and adult home nursing services in northern New Jersey.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The acquisition was effective as of February 1.</p>
<p>Pediatric Services provides pediatric home health care services.</p>
</text>
